    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "绘制伯德图的分步步骤：1) 将传递函数化为伯德标准型；2) 确定 n 并绘制低频幅值渐近线；3) 在转折频率处改变斜率以完成复合幅值渐近线；4) 修正转折频率处的幅值曲线；5) 绘制低频相角渐近线；6) 指导绘制相角曲线的近似变化走向；7) 确定各单项相角曲线的渐近线；8) 图解叠加各相角曲线。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "A step-by-step procedure for constructing Bode plots: 1) Manipulate transfer function into Bode form; 2) Determine n and plot low-frequency magnitude asymptote; 3) Complete composite magnitude asymptotes by stepping slope at break points; 4) Adjust magnitude curve at break points; 5) Plot low-frequency phase asymptote; 6) Guide approximate phase curve changes; 7) Locate asymptotes for individual phase curves; 8) Graphically add phase curves.",
